#: ../../../release/dev/msvc-c-extensions.rst:2
msgid "msvc-c-extensions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release/dev/msvc-c-extensions.rst:4
msgid ""
"The :prop_tgt:`C_EXTENSIONS` target property is now honored by the ``MSVC`` "
"compiler from Visual Studio 2022 version 17.2 or above and by ``clang-cl`` "
"19.1 or above.  ``OFF`` adds ``/Zc:__STDC__`` for the C11 and later "
"standards, which disables the Microsoft and UCRT extensions. See "
"policy :policy:`CMP0233`."
msgstr ""
